msgid "The FullScreen Plugin for the Richtext Editor (CKEditor 5) has been added for the Enhanced Mode of the editor. Enhanced Mode can be activated for the Agent and Customer Interface by enabling the ``Frontend::RichText::EnhancedMode`` and the ``Frontend::RichText::EnhancedMode::Customer`` configuration option respectively."
